  "id": "no-child-left-behind-act",
  "term": "No Child Left Behind Act",
  "definition": "The No Child Left Behind Act is an education reform law described here as promoting high-stakes standardized testing and accountability benchmarks. In this context, it is linked to increased use of highly structured “no excuses” school models and strict behavior policies in elementary schools.",
